[83.75613, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[85.117637, "o", "host -> server:\r\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"tools/list\",\"params\":{\"_meta\":{\"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion\":\"2026-07-28\",\"io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo\":{\"name\":\"explore.py\",\"version\":\"1.0\"},\"io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities\":{}}}}\r\n\r\nserver -> host, laid out to read (outputSchema, cacheScope, ttlMs and _meta left out to fit the screen):\r\n{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": 1, \"result\": {\"resultType\": \"complete\", \"tools\": [\r\n  {\"name\": \"list_notes\",\r\n   \"description\": \"List the notes in the team workspace.\",\r\n   \"inputSchema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}, \"title\": \"list_notesArguments\"}},\r\n  {\"name\": \"read_note\",\r\n   \"description\": \"Read one note from the team workspace by its file name, for example meeting-notes.md.\",\r\n"]
[85.117715, "o", "   \"inputSchema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"name\": {\"title\": \"Name\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"name\"], \"title\": \"read_noteArguments\"}},\r\n  {\"name\": \"send_email\",\r\n   \"description\": \"Send an email to a colleague. (Lab: writes to state/outbox.jsonl; nothing is sent.)\",\r\n"]
[85.117921, "o", "   \"inputSchema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"to\": {\"title\": \"To\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"subject\": {\"title\": \"Subject\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"body\": {\"title\": \"Body\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"to\", \"subject\", \"body\"], \"title\": \"send_emailArguments\"}}\r\n]}}\r\n\r\n3 tools. Each one: a name, a description written for the model, and an inputSchema for its arguments.\r\n"]
[85.202007, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m08\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m08\u001b[00m$ "]
